{{also|Drucken|drücken|Drücken}}
==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|drucken}}, from {{inh|de|goh|drucchen}}, from {{der|de|gem-pro|*þrukkijaną||to press}}. {{doublet|de|drücken|t1=to press, push}} with [[Upper German]] lack of umlaut before a velar geminate; the first German printers were in the south.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/ˈdrʊkən/|[ˈdʁʊ.kŋ̍]|[-kən]}}
* {{audio|de|De-drucken.ogg|Audio}}
* {{audio|de|De-drucken2.ogg|Audio}}
* {{audio|de|De-drucken3.ogg|Audio}}
* {{audio|de|De-at-drucken.ogg|Audio (Austria)}}

